#: providers/models/openai/llm/schemas/gpt_4_1106_preview.py:38
#: providers/models/openai/llm/schemas/gpt_4_32k.py:38
#: providers/models/openai/llm/schemas/gpt_4_turbo_2024_04_09.py:39
msgid ""
"If specified, model will make a best effort to sample deterministically, "
"such that repeated requests with the same seed and parameters should "
"return the same result.Determinism is not guaranteed, and you should "
"refer to the system_fingerprint response parameter"
msgstr ""
"If specified, model will make a best effort to sample deterministically, "
"such that repeated requests with the same seed and parameters should "
"return the same result.Determinism is not guaranteed, and you should "
"refer to the system_fingerprint response parameter"

#: providers/models/openai/llm/schemas/gpt_4_turbo.py:39
#: providers/models/openai/llm/schemas/gpt_4_turbo_preview.py:38
#: providers/models/openai/llm/schemas/gpt_4_vision_preview.py:36
msgid ""
"If specified, model will make a best effort to sample deterministically, "
"such that repeated requests with the same seed and parameters should "
"return the same result. Determinism is not guaranteed, and you should "
"refer to the system_fingerprint response parameter to monitor changes in "
"the backend."
msgstr ""
"If specified, model will make a best effort to sample deterministically, "
"such that repeated requests with the same seed and parameters should "
"return the same result. Determinism is not guaranteed, and you should "
"refer to the system_fingerprint response parameter to monitor changes in "
"the backend."

